WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080
For existing data, open the matching Protocol’s Records and choose Bulk upload.

2
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:16.400
Download this version’s CSV template. Keep its standard headers and prepare UTF-8 CSV.

3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:24.320
First try the invalid example: its count contains #REF!. Select it and validate.

4
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:32.160
Errors identify the field and location. Invalid input creates no Records.

5
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:40.480
Replace the file with the corrected example. Do not guess missing values in real data.

6
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:48.360
A successful preview has not written data. Check the count, Protocol and version, then acknowledge.

7
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:55.280
Confirm the import to save these two synthetic rows.

8
00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:05.680
Reload and verify: DEMO-101 is 0; DEMO-102 is 12. Do not upload again after success.
